1
00:00:03,303 --> 00:00:04,303
What are you looking for?

2
00:00:04,871 --> 00:00:06,473
Well...

3
00:00:06,473 --> 00:00:08,475
Have you seen a photo?

4
00:00:08,842 --> 00:00:09,776
A photo?

5
00:00:09,776 --> 00:00:10,777
What photo?

6
00:00:12,178 --> 00:00:13,246
It's nothing.

7
00:00:15,715 --> 00:00:16,816
I lied to her.

8
00:00:17,283 --> 00:00:18,718
This is for sure.

9
00:00:18,718 --> 00:00:20,720
Hye-won has a crush on Eun-ho.

10
00:00:20,854 --> 00:00:22,856
What's going to happen
if Eun-ho sees this?

11
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:24,890
Boss?

12
00:00:25,392 --> 00:00:26,192
What?

13
00:00:26,192 --> 00:00:27,093
What's the matter?

14
00:00:27,093 --> 00:00:28,762
Where did the photo go?

15
00:00:29,329 --> 00:00:30,130
May I ask

16
00:00:30,130 --> 00:00:31,331
for an advance payment?

17
00:00:31,765 --> 00:00:33,299
Right, advance payment.

18
00:00:33,733 --> 00:00:35,378
Do you want it in your
monthly wage account?

19
00:00:35,402 --> 00:00:36,569
Are you not going to
ask me why?

20
00:00:36,569 --> 00:00:37,904
No, it's okay.

21
00:00:38,171 --> 00:00:39,539
You must have
your own reasons.

22
00:00:39,939 --> 00:00:41,708
Advance payment or whatever
you want, I'll give it to you.

23
00:00:41,708 --> 00:00:42,708
Just take it and leave.

24
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:44,410
Thank you.

25
00:00:45,111 --> 00:00:46,111
Huh?

26
00:00:53,253 --> 00:00:54,654
- Did you see it?
- Pardon?

27
00:00:54,654 --> 00:00:55,522
I said, did you see it?

28
00:00:55,522 --> 00:00:57,357
How can I see it when
you took it away like that?

29
00:00:57,357 --> 00:00:59,059
Alright then.

30
00:00:59,893 --> 00:01:00,893
You can leave.

31
00:01:05,698 --> 00:01:06,900
That was close.

32
00:01:12,772 --> 00:01:13,772
The boss...

33
00:01:15,708 --> 00:01:18,011
might have feelings for me.
